BARBAAD HUWA HAYE MOHAMMED KA GHARANA<br>
<br>
Zakhmi huwa Humshakl-e-Payambar ka kaleja<br>
Seene mein tha atthara(18) baras wale ke naiza<br>
Jab mar gaya Laila ka pisar mannato wala<br>
Shabbir ne rote huwe bachcho ko pukara<br>
<br>
Maidan ko phir Aun-o-Mohammed bhi sidhare<br>
Sarwar pa fida hogaye Zainab ke dulare<br>
Qaimo mein junhi aagaye do betaun ke laashe<br>
Lasho&rsquo;n ke qaree&rsquo;n Zainab-e-Muztar ka wo sajda<br>
<br>
Shadi huwe kuch der ki dulhan bani kubra<br>
Phir Qasim-e-Naushah bhi maqtal ko sidhara<br>
Shabbir ne kis dil se khuda jaane hai dekha<br>
Maidan me bikhra huwa Shabbar ka kaleja<br>
<br>
Abbas ke shaane kate tha Zakhmi sarapa<br>
Mashkiza chhida sar pa laga gurz-e-sitam ka<br>
Ghode se gira kaise khuda jane wo pyasa<br>
Shabbir kamar thame huwe padhte the nauha<br>
<br>
Chhe (6) maah ke Asgher ke gale par jo laga teer<br>
Us nanhe se laashe ko liye rote the Shabbir<br>
Bechain dar-e-qaima pe the Bano-e-dilgeer<br>
Shai sonchte the ghamzada maadar se kahe kya<br>
<br>
Jab Fatema ka laal huwa dasht mein tanha<br>
Mazloom pa hone laga har simt se hamla<br>
Talwaar kabhi teer to pathar kabhi naiza<br>
Ghode pa laga jhoomne Ahmed ka nawasa<br>
<br>
Zakhmi huwa ghode se gira Dilbar-e-Hyder<br>
Chillati rahi peet ke sar Zainab-e-Muztar<br>
Aur Sibt-e-Payambar ke gale par chala khanjar<br>
Faryaad kuna dasht mein thi Fatima Zehra<br>
<br>
Aye Saqi-e-Kausar ke pisar dilbar-e-Zehra<br>
Marooza Rasheed apse karta hai ye aqa<br>
Hum sab ko dikha dijiye jald apka roza<br>
Karlije qubool ap ye na cheez ka nauha
